&lt;p&gt;Product at HelloFresh is exciting. We’re talking recipe ranges, box types and, or product additions such as our surcharge portfolio (range of value added recipes that customers can pay extra for to acquire).&amp;nbsp; Reporting directly into our Head of Menu Strategy and Product Development,&amp;nbsp; you will sit at the vital intersection of customer, operations and web-development. Without this team, we can’t stay number one globally and so we want someone to come in and use their energy, passion and outstanding project management to help us continue to give customers the best products in the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategically own and manage the end-to-end range and assortment planning for Surcharge (HelloFresh and GC) and Market for HelloFresh UK.&lt;/strong&gt; This involves significant collaboration with the global HFM team, who manage much of the strategic planning, to ensure local execution aligns with global initiatives while driving basket penetration and safeguarding high-margin revenue streams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead performance reporting and tracking &lt;/strong&gt;across all value-added revenue streams, utilizing data-driven insights to optimize product performance, drive margin growth, and identify opportunities for AOV and basket expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive innovation by curating and sourcing new concepts, premium recipes, and high-performing Market additions&lt;/strong&gt; that enhance customer value perception and complement our core meal kit offering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate closely with the culinary team &lt;/strong&gt;to translate new product concepts and insights into tangible, appealing recipes that align with our surcharge and market strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the process for new SKU proposals, forecasting, and assortment refinement&lt;/strong&gt;, bridging the gap between innovation and commercial viability to ensure every addition contributes to long-term profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work cross-functionally &lt;/strong&gt;to ensure flawless execution of the product innovation roadmap for value added products, playing a key role in helping shape the future of HelloFresh UK’s premium product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with Product Marketing and Brand teams &lt;/strong&gt;to build compelling commercial stories for value-added products, maximizing customer lifetime value through targeted initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being a champion for your customers within the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years’ experience within either a commercial FMCG role, such as brand / category management (e-commerce experience is a bonus), or a top tier consultancy within these industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding project management skills, and the ability to keep the plates spinning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work cross-functionally to drive through product initiatives in a complex structure with global stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working with data to build business cases and make recommendations to the UK and global teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-centric mindset, including the ability to use data to identify unmet customer needs and pain points&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative thinking to develop solutions that solve our customers’ challenges and an entrepreneurial attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience is executing digital tests and working with digital products.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in food, e-commerce and digital merchandising would be a bonus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● 70% off HelloFresh or Green Chef boxes&lt;br&gt;● Company pension scheme&lt;br&gt;● Gym membership&lt;br&gt;● Bupa private medical insurance (including dental &amp;amp; family cover options)&lt;br&gt;● Mental health first aiders and an employee assistance programme&lt;br&gt;● Dog friendly office! (London site only)&lt;br&gt;● Nursery support scheme&lt;br&gt;● Cycle to work scheme&lt;br&gt;● Group Life Assurance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: The HelloFresh Farm, 60 Worship Street, EC2A 2EZ, London&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To be considered for this role, you’ll need to have the independent right to work in the UK, as we&#39;re unfortunately unable to provide sponsorship at this time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Hybrid Working Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer a hybrid working policy for eligible roles, allowing flexibility to work from home and in the office. For more details on eligibility and how this applies to the role you&#39;re applying for, please consult with your recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;: Your application will be reviewed and if successful, a member of the Talent Acquisition Team will be in touch within 2 weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are required to cooperate with HelloFresh in all health and safety matters. You are responsible for ensuring you take reasonable care of your own health, and safety as well as others who may be affected by the work activities you undertake. You must report incidents immediately and actively raise health and safety-related concerns to your Line Manager.&amp;nbsp;As part of our commitment to maintaining a safe and secure environment, we will process Disclosure and Barring Service (&lt;span class=&quot;il&quot;&gt;DBS&lt;/span&gt;) checks to the successful individual. Failure to disclose relevant information at application or throughout the process could affect your employment with the company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are currently a HelloFresh employee, please make sure you have discussed your application with your Line Manager.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission Brief&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we increase our launch cadence and expand our launch operations across multiple sites, we are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Senior Program Manager Launch Services&lt;/strong&gt; in our Mission and Launch Operations team in Germany to drive integrated launch planning and scheduling across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will become the central coordination point for launch planning between mission management, launch operations, development and production. Your mission is to ensure that customer commitments, launch site availability, operational capacity, hardware readiness, and development roadmaps are translated into a coherent and executable launch schedule.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your Role in Our Space Mission:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Launch Planning &amp;amp; Coordination&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and maintain the integrated launch schedule across missions, campaigns, and launch sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate launch site bookings, flight allocations, and key hardware delivery milestones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment of launch plans with customer commitments and operational readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify capability, resource constraints and bottlenecks before they impact mission execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive resolution of schedule conflicts, critical path issues, and execution risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Forecasting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop launch forecasts and capacity planning to support operational and commercial objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Performance &amp;amp; Cost Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report KPIs, mission performance metrics, and launch campaign costs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support budget planning through cost monitoring and forecasting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Executive Reporting &amp;amp; Strategic Alignment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide consolidated schedule, capacity, risk, and performance reporting to senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a single source of truth for the launch schedule and launch capacities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualification Checklist&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s / Master’s degree in aerospace engineering, business administration or other relevant fields&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of proven experience in program management, project management, or operations management within aerospace, automotive, manufacturing, defense, or another highly complex engineering environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of technical dependencies and interrelationships across engineering, production and operations organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management skills and the ability to align teams around common objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding communication skills and confidence interacting with both technical experts and senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive mindset with strong problem-solving abilities and a focus on execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional proficiency in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bonus Skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in launch services, spaceflight operations, aerospace programs, mission management, or launch campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with production planning, capacity planning, and forecasting methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in operational campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Participation Program:&lt;/strong&gt; Share in our success through our virtual company share program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 days of vacation: &lt;/strong&gt;Enjoy the days off to relax and recharge &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company pension plan:&lt;/strong&gt; Secure your future with our company pension plan, featuring a 20% employer contribution after the probation period&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subsidised lunch:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay energised with delicious, subsidised lunches every day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Public transport ticket:&lt;/strong&gt; Commute with ease using a fully financed Deutschlandticket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sport Clubs membership:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay fit with our sponsored sports club memberships (EGYM Wellpass)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning allowance:&lt;/strong&gt; Grow your skills with an individual learning budget granted after the probation period&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Childcare allowance:&lt;/strong&gt; Receive a childcare allowance for your non-school-age children&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And Much More!&lt;/strong&gt; Discover additional perks and benefits when you join our team. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Who we are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/jW2V5vsMb_k&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;We are Isar Aerospace and we are at the forefront of New Space building a modern space business to enable faster, better and cheaper access to space.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Our mission is to help democratise space and use it for good in order to improve life on Earth now and for the future generations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;We are a fast-growing company aiming to provide sustainable and environmentally friendly launch solutions for small and medium-sized satellites and constellations into Low Earth Orbit. The company is privately funded by world-leading technology investors with strong commitment and support and our team is made of driven and talented people with a real passion for space innovation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;We&#39;re making rockets in a way that hasn&#39;t been done before disrupting a traditional industry. If you are up for the challenge, want to work on cutting-edge projects and be part of a team changing the world for better, come, join us and launch your career!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Want to find out more about us?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.isaraerospace.com/&quot;&gt;www.isaraerospace.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Protection&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We process your personal data for the purpose of managing the recruitment process and assessing your application. For detailed information on how your data is processed, including your rights, please refer to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://isaraerospace.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Disclaimer&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Isar Aerospace SE is an equal-opportunity employer committed to fairness and inclusivity. We do not prioritize any specific religion, gender, nationality, or background. Due to security clearance requirements, affiliations with countries listed under § 13 para. 1 no. 17 SÜG may affect the application process. All qualified applicants are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;Wrike is the most powerful work management platform. Built for teams and organizations looking to collaborate, create, and exceed every day, Wrike brings everyone and all work into a single place to remove complexity, increase productivity, and free people up to focus on their most purposeful work.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Wrike is our people, not a place. As a distributed team, we own our growth, stay globally connected, and rely on the product we build to deliver impactful work alongside brilliant minds. You&#39;ll have real ownership over meaningful work, a global team that has your back, and the flexibility to do your best work your way. If that sounds like you, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our vision:&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;A world where everyone is free to focus on their most purposeful work, together.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About the Role:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work alongside diverse, cross-border teams and supportive colleagues who share knowledge and want to see you succeed. We’re looking for a Group Product Manager to lead Klaxoon — the product area responsible for Wrike’s visual collaboration strategy and the evolution of whiteboarding experiences within the broader CWM platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will define and lead the strategy of Wrike Whiteboards across the key pillars: whiteboard core experience, AI strategy, vertical-oriented use cases, convergence between Wrike and Klaxoon, and customer retention. You will balance innovation, customer stewardship, product unification, and business needs while shaping the future role of visual collaboration in Wrike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact leadership role for someone who can combine strong product strategy, people leadership, customer empathy, AI-native thinking, and organizational integration. You will help transform Klaxoon into a world-class visual collaboration tool while developing the PM team into stronger strategic product leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your Impact:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and drive the Klaxoon strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Set the vision, priorities, and roadmap for Klaxoon across the core whiteboard experience, AI strategy, vertical differentiation, and Wrike/Klaxoon convergence into a single seamless product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow whiteboard adoption and experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Continuously raise the bar on the Klaxoon product experience to make it a world-class visual collaboration tool, with strong focus on driving adoption among Wrike customers and identifying high-value vertical use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable AI-native R&amp;amp;D:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to building the processes, tooling, and mindsets needed for the R&amp;amp;D organization to work AI-natively, identifying where agentic workflows can change how the team operates and scales output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop the PM team:&lt;/strong&gt; Coach, mentor, and grow a team of Product Managers - helping them move from feature ownership to strategic product leadership while building a shared product culture across Wrike and Klaxoon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your qualifications:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product leadership experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience leading product managers or managing a complex product area with multiple teams and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong core PM craft and customer-centric mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of product discovery, customer validation, positioning, roadmap strategy, prioritization, metrics, and product delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise SaaS experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong knowledge of B2B SaaS and enterprise customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic prioritization:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to make hard trade-offs across incomparable investments, customer expectations, product convergence, innovation, and long-term strategic direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional leadership and stakeholder management:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to align teams and stakeholders across Product, Engineering, Design, Sales, Marketing, Customer Success, Solution Consulting, and executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People management skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience coaching, mentoring, hiring, developing, and managing performance of product managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-native thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Practical understanding of AI-native product strategy and ability to identify differentiated AI use cases in visual collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good UX judgment:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to balance product power, simplicity, adoption, and customer experience in collaborative tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Standout Qualities:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in visual collaboration, whiteboarding, CWM, work management, or team collaboration products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical understanding of agentic workflows and AI-native product development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in French is a strong plus - the team is mostly France-based.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visionary mindset and ability to redefine complex product areas for the AI-native future.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visual collaboration impact:&lt;/strong&gt; You will shape the future of Klaxoon as a world-class whiteboarding and visual collaboration experience inside Wrike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic complexity:&lt;/strong&gt; The role requires balancing adoption, AI, vertical strategy, customer retention, product convergence, and innovation in one highly visible product area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-native transformation:&lt;/strong&gt; You will help define how visual collaboration evolves in a future where AI changes how teams brainstorm, align, plan, and execute work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organizational integration:&lt;/strong&gt; You will strengthen the link between Wrike and Klaxoon teams, products, and cultures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s Next? &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exploratory call with a Recruiter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meeting with the hiring manager - Product Director&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Panel interview with Product, Engineering, and Design representatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home task&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final interview with the CPO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PLEASE APPLY WITH YOUR CV IN ENGLISH.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your recruitment buddy will be&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/alexandravorobyova/&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Alexandra Vorobyova&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, Lead Recruiter.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-AV1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who Is Wrike and Our Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We’re a team of innovators and creators who solve the complex work problems of today and tomorrow.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work mode&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Wrike is our people, not a place. With 1,000+ employees collaborating across nearly every time zone, we support talent through 10 global hubs — Australia, Costa Rica, Cyprus, Czechia, Estonia, France, India, Ireland, Japan, and the United States — offering flexible ways of working that include remote work, hybrid environments, and co-working spaces across many locations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;While flexibility looks different across teams and regions, employees located near certain hubs — particularly in Prague (CZ), Nicosia (CY), Bangalore (IN), and Rennes (FR) — are generally expected to collaborate in person around 2–3 days per week, balancing the flexibility of distributed work with opportunities for in-person collaboration and connection.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our persona&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💡&amp;nbsp; Smart:&lt;/strong&gt; We love what we do, and we’re great at it because this is our domain. Our combined knowledge in this space is unmatched.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💚&amp;nbsp; Dedicated: &lt;/strong&gt;We get up every day focused on helping our customers win. We’re committed to helping our teammates win, too!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤗&amp;nbsp; Approachable:&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re friendly, easy to get along with, considerate, and helpful.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our culture and Values&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 Customer-Focused&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We care about our customers. &lt;/strong&gt;We understand the customer journey, experience, and value derived from Wrike. Decision-making and action-taking are done with the customer in mind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤝 Collaborative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We work as one and win together, &lt;/strong&gt;each bringing unique strengths that contribute to diversity of thought for better outcomes. Leveraging our own work management platform, we foster an environment of creative collaboration and shared achievement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎨 Creative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We strive to succeed through continuous innovation. &lt;/strong&gt;It’s our pursuit of novel concepts that helped us create a market category. We continue to cultivate a workplace that fosters creative thinking as a means of transcending conventional boundaries and empowers us to break new ground to deliver extraordinary work management solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💪 Committed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe in ownership at all levels of the organization, &lt;/strong&gt;by owning workflows from start to finish. Each member of our team is an integral part of this commitment, establishing work as a platform for personal growth and transformation, as well as collective success and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
