&lt;li&gt;Experience with prompt engineering or LLM orchestration frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating with enterprise systems or internal business tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with event-driven architectures, queues, and task orchestration systems.&lt;/li&gt;
