&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-CY1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Burson to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Burson, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;Graduate Programme — Scale Space&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are you torn between the excitement of start-ups and the stability of corporate life?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are you keen to continue learning and developing skills whilst experiencing how to build businesses?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are you looking for a role that will offer the opportunity to experience first-hand how a growing business operates, while being supported to take ownership of work that matters?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you and you are up for the challenge, we would love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are looking to hire high-energy, entrepreneurial and value-adding graduate talent to join Blenheim Chalcot in a role dedicated entirely to&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Space&lt;/strong&gt;, one of the businesses within the Blenheim Chalcot portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;ABOUT US&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;At Blenheim Chalcot, we invest more than just funds. We invest our knowledge and experience, our ideas and infrastructure. Our ventures are at the forefront of a multitude of industries being disrupted by digital, including FinTech, EdTech, GovTech, Media, Sport, Charity and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are highly entrepreneurial and seek opportunities where digital technologies can disrupt major markets. Ventures we have built include ClearScore, Salary Finance, Modulr and the Rajasthan Royals cricket team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Many of the companies within the portfolio have materialised from ideas conceived and launched by us, and we have over 4,000 employees supporting their growth and development. Our assets under management stand at more than £1.8bn and total portfolio revenue is over £500 million.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We work closely with investment and strategic partners including PayPal, FIS, L&amp;amp;G, Tencent, Experian, Google, Worldpay, Imperial College and some of the leading venture capital and private equity companies internationally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Our central team, Venture Builder Services (VBS), exists to support our ventures to be successful quickly, sustainably and with access to best-practice tools, solutions and expertise. We provide a range of services to help new businesses get off the ground, including technology, growth, talent, finance, legal and tax.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;IMPACT BEYOND PROFIT&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;15% of our partnerships and ventures are charities. These include the British Asian Trust, Babyzone and OnSide Youth Zones. In the same way that we support our ventures, our Partners provide direct hands-on support to these charities by being active board members and offering expert advice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;ABOUT SCALE SPACE&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Scale Space is a community and workspace designed to bring together ambitious businesses, entrepreneurs, scale-ups and innovators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Based in White City, Scale Space provides more than just flexible workspace. It creates an environment where growing businesses can connect, collaborate and access the networks, expertise and opportunities they need to scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;The team works across community, events, partnerships, operations and customer experience to ensure that members receive a high-quality experience while helping to build a connected and ambitious business community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;THE GRADUATE OPPORTUNITY&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Joining Blenheim Chalcot as a Graduate, you will gain hands-on experience in a fast-paced and progressive environment while working exclusively with&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Space&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You will be embedded within the Scale Space team and contribute to meaningful projects across the business, while benefiting from Blenheim Chalcot&#39;s learning, development and employee benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;For you as a graduate, this opportunity involves:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dedicated to Scale Space&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– although you will be employed by Blenheim Chalcot, your role will sit fully within Scale Space. Your day-to-day work, projects and objectives will be focused entirely on supporting Scale Space and its growth, giving you the opportunity to build deep experience within a fast-moving and entrepreneurial business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– we pride ourselves on having an intentional and continuous learning and development culture at Blenheim Chalcot. You will have access to BC learning and development opportunities designed to strengthen your core professional, commercial and leadership skills, while applying that learning directly to your work at Scale Space. You will learn by doing, taking on real responsibility and developing quickly within the Scale Space team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Early Careers Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– as a BC graduate, you will have access to structured development opportunities designed for those early in their careers. These will support your professional growth while your substantive role remains fully dedicated to Scale Space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Graduate Community&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– you will be part of the wider BC graduate community, with access to relevant learning sessions, networking opportunities and socials. This community is intended to support your development and connection with fellow graduates; your substantive role and day-to-day responsibilities will remain entirely within Scale Space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accountability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– you will be given meaningful responsibility from the outset and supported to take ownership of work that matters. Rather than rotating between businesses, you will build continuity and depth within Scale Space and see the direct impact of your work on the business, its members and the wider community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;ARE YOU BC?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are not expecting you to have worked in start-ups before or to have studied a tech-related degree. For us, it is about hiring the right person and their potential, not just their experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;As such, we are looking for graduates from any discipline. Different areas of expertise bring valuable new perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We look for some key fundamentals in people when hiring into the BC Group. We look for people who are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– people in BC are inquisitive. They want to understand ‘why’ and consider whether there is a better approach rather than simply accepting ‘it’s how we’ve always done it’. Given our ethos is all about disrupting industries with new methods and products, curiosity is at the heart of what we do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;‘Doers’&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– we are a community of proactive self-starters. We will provide full support to our graduates, but we look for people who can use their initiative, take ownership and drive work forward on a daily basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– working in a growth business environment is ambiguous, diverse and, at times, chaotic by definition. Being adaptable and recognising the importance of flexibility in order to add value in a constantly evolving company is vital.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enthusiasm&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– you do not need to be a ‘techy’ at heart to work in our environment. We are looking for people who are enthusiastic about innovation, growth and the changing nature of industries, with a desire to work in an environment where new and challenging things happen every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Humble &amp;amp; Sociable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– building and scaling businesses is never easy. As such, we have a ‘no-ego’ policy and seek out people who bring energy to a team rather than drain it. We have a down-to-earth and personable culture; we solve complex problems but do not take ourselves too seriously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;If you see yourself in this and would like to work with similarly minded people, we would love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;WHAT WE CAN OFFER YOU AS A BC EMPLOYEE&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of the UK’s leading digital venture builder and have the opportunity to learn from the incredible talent across BC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be exposed to the right mix of challenge, responsibility and learning and development opportunities while building deep, hands-on experience within Scale Space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fun and open, if a little cricket-obsessed, atmosphere.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary bonus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid holiday plus your birthday off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance, Pension Scheme and Cycle to Work Scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Benefits including Private Medical and Dental cover and gym subsidies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;APPLICATION &amp;amp; PROCESS&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;If you are keen to apply, please submit your CV and a member of our Talent Team will contact you with next steps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We have a rigorous recruitment process, which we use for all our roles to ensure we attract the very best talent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We have a three-stage process:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 1:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Telephone interview with a member of the BC Talent Team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 2:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Virtual assessment day, consisting of both individual and group activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 3:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Final interviews with Blenheim Chalcot and Scale Space at Scale Space, White City.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note that the timeframes provided above are subject to change. Any changes will be communicated throughout the process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Blenheim Chalcot is a proud Equal Opportunity Employer. Diversity is one of our core values and is central to our business. We strive to maximise the diversity of our workforce and welcome applications from everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We encourage diversity of perspective, background, identity and thought, while fostering an environment where everyone can express themselves regardless of race, religion, sex, gender, colour, national origin, disability or any other legally protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to continuing to nurture an inclusive environment and building a diverse workforce.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your CV you understand that we have a legitimate interest to use your personal data for the purposes of assessing your eligibility for this role.&amp;nbsp; This means that we may use your personal data to contact you to discuss your CV or arrange an interview, or transfer your CV to the hiring manager(s) of the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp; You can ask us at any time to remove your CV from our database by emailing&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- but please note that this means we will no longer consider you for the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp;You can review our privacy policy&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.blenheimchalcot.com/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Graduate Programme — Babyzone&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you torn between the excitement of start-ups and the stability of corporate life?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you keen to continue learning and developing skills whilst experiencing how to build businesses?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you looking for a role that will offer the opportunity to experience first-hand how a tech company is built, and be supported while taking ownership of work that matters?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like you and you are up for the challenge, we would love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking to hire high-energy, entrepreneurial and value-adding graduate talent to join Blenheim Chalcot in a role dedicated entirely to Babyzone, one of the social-impact organisations supported by BC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT US&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Blenheim Chalcot, we invest more than just funds. We invest our knowledge and experience, our ideas and infrastructure. Our ventures are at the forefront of a multitude of industries being disrupted by digital including FinTech, EdTech, GovTech, Media, Sport, Charity and more. We are highly entrepreneurial and seek opportunities where digital technologies can disrupt major markets - ventures we have built include ClearScore, Salary Finance, Modulr and the Rajasthan Royals cricket team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Many of the companies within the portfolio have materialised from ideas conceived and launched by us, and we have over 4,000 employees to support their growth and development. Our assets under management stand at more than £1.8bn and total portfolio revenue is over £500 million.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work closely with investment and strategic partners ranging from Paypal, FIS, L&amp;amp;G, Tencent, Experian, Google, WorldPay, Imperial College and some of the leading venture capital and private equity companies internationally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our central team, Venture Builder Services (VBS), exists to support our ventures to be successful quickly, sustainably and with access to the best practice tools, solutions, and expertise. We provide a range of services to help new business get off the ground, including technology, growth (marketing and sales), talent, finance, legal and tax.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;IMPACT BEYOND PROFIT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;15% of our partnerships and ventures are charities. These include the British Asian Trust,&amp;nbsp;Babyzone and Onside Youth Zones. In the same way that we support our ventures, our Partners provide direct hands-on support to these charities by being active board members and offering expert advice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ABOUT BABYZONE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Babyzone is&amp;nbsp;an innovative and fast-growing UK early childhood charity. It runs free, open-access community hubs for families with children aged 0-5 in areas of high deprivation, bringing together services, programmes and partners to improve outcomes for young children and their families.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;THE GRADUATE OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining Blenheim Chalcot as a Graduate, you will gain hands-on experience in a fast-paced and progressive environment while working exclusively with Babyzone. You will be embedded within the Babyzone team and contribute to meaningful projects that support the charity&#39;s growth, operations and impact, while benefiting from Blenheim Chalcot&#39;s learning, development and employee benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For you as a graduate, this opportunity involves:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dedicated to Babyzone – although you will be employed by Blenheim Chalcot, your role will sit fully within Babyzone. Your day-to-day work, projects and objectives will be focused entirely on supporting Babyzone and its mission, giving you the opportunity to build deep experience within a fast-growing, mission-led organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training &amp;amp; Development – we pride ourselves on having an intentional and continuous learning and development culture at Blenheim Chalcot. You will have access to BC learning and development opportunities designed to strengthen your core professional, commercial and leadership skills, while applying that learning directly to your work at Babyzone. You will learn by doing, taking on real responsibility and developing quickly within the Babyzone team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Early Careers Development – as a BC graduate, you will have access to structured development opportunities designed for those early in their careers. These will support your professional growth while your role itself remains fully dedicated to Babyzone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduate Community – you will be part of the wider BC graduate community, with access to relevant learning sessions, networking opportunities and socials. This community is intended to support your development and connection with fellow graduates; your substantive role and day-to-day responsibilities will remain entirely within Babyzone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountability – you will be given meaningful responsibility from the outset and supported to take ownership of work that matters. Rather than rotating between businesses, you will build continuity and depth within Babyzone, seeing the direct impact of your work on the organisation and the families and communities it serves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ARE YOU BC?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are not expecting you to have worked in start-ups before or to have studied a tech related degree. For us, it is about hiring the right person and their potential, not just their experience. As such, we are looking for graduates from any discipline – different areas of expertise are great for new perspectives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look for some key fundamentals in people when hiring into the BC Group. We look for people who are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;– people in BC are inquisitive, they want to understand ‘why’ and consider if there is a better approach rather than take on the ‘it’s how we’ve always done it’ perspective. Given our ethos is all about disrupting industries with new methods and products, curiosity is at the heart of what we do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;‘Doers’&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;– surprisingly, this is not a given in a lot of working environments; we are a community of pro-active self-starters. We will provide full support to our graduates, though we do look for proactive people who can use their initiative and drive on a daily basis. Working in an environment where everyone has this trait is incredibly refreshing and we strive to maintain it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Mindset –&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;working in a growth business environment is ambiguous, diverse and, at times, chaotic by definition. Being adaptable and recognising the importance of flexibility to add value in a constantly evolving company is vital for us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enthusiasm –&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;you do not need to be a ‘techy’ at heart to work in our environment. We are looking for people who are enthusiastic about what digitalisation is doing to industries and a drive to work in a pioneering sector which represents that drive. A desire for doing new and challenging things makes coming into work a whole lot more fun.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Humble &amp;amp; Sociable&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;– building a tech start-up is never easy. As such, we have a ‘no-ego’ policy and seek out people who bring energy to a team, not drain it. We have a down-to-earth and personable culture; we solve complex problems but do not take ourselves too seriously and look to have fun whilst doing so.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you see yourself in this and would like to work with similarly minded people, we would love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WHAT WE CAN OFFER YOU AS A BC EMPLOYEE:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of the UK’s leading digital venture builder and have the opportunity to be a part of and learn from the incredible talent in BC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be exposed to the right mix of challenges and learning and development opportunities while building deep, hands-on experience within Babyzone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fun and open, if a little cricket obsessed, atmosphere&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid holidays + your birthday off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance, Pension Scheme, Cycle to Work Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Benefits including Private Medical and Dental, Gym Subsidiaries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;APPLICATION &amp;amp; PROCESS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are keen to apply, please submit your CV and a member of our Talent Team will contact you with next steps. We have a rigorous recruitment process, which we use for all our roles to ensure we attract the very best talent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a three-stage process that will consist of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stage 1: Telephone interview with a member of the BC Talent team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 2:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Virtual assessment day, consisting of both individual and group activities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stage 3: Final interviews with Blenheim Chalcot and Babyzone at Scale Space, White City&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Please note the timeframes provided above are subject to change, which we will communicate throughout the process*&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Blenheim Chalcot is a proud Equal Opportunity Employer. Diversity is one of our core values, thus making it core to our business. We strive to maximise the diversity of our workforce and welcome applications from everyone. We encourage diversity through perspective, background, identity, and thought whilst also fostering an environment where everyone can express themselves regardless of your race, religion, sex, gender, colour, national origin, disability, or any other applicable legally protected characteristic. We are committed to continuing to nurture an inclusive environment and building a diverse workforce.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your CV you understand that we have a legitimate interest to use your personal data for the purposes of assessing your eligibility for this role.&amp;nbsp; This means that we may use your personal data to contact you to discuss your CV or arrange an interview, or transfer your CV to the hiring manager(s) of the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp; You can ask us at any time to remove your CV from our database by emailing&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- but please note that this means we will no longer consider you for the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp;You can review our privacy policy&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.blenheimchalcot.com/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;Senior Analyst - CX Automation Intelligence &amp;amp; Insights&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a hybrid role to our Berlin HelloFresh Headquarters Office&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with HelloFresh in Berlin and its HelloTech organisation, HelloFresh’s global technology backbone with more than 1000 people, building the digital products that power our end-to-end food experience. From meal kits and ready-to-eat meals to specialty offerings like pet food and premium meat &amp;amp; seafood, HelloTech creates the platforms that bring tailored food solutions to millions of customers every month.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our subscription-based, direct-to-consumer model relies on technology at every step, from customer-facing apps and personalization logic to pricing, forecasting, supply chain optimization, and initiatives that help reduce food waste. While our brands operate independently to serve distinct customer needs, they are united by shared platforms, data, and operational excellence built by HelloTech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloTech works in autonomous, cross-functional alliances, each owning a specific product or domain end to end. By working with our Warsaw office, you will help shape scalable, data-driven products used across our markets, working with a modern tech stack and international teams to continuously improve how people discover, order, and enjoy HelloFresh’s products, today and in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Data Analyst at HelloFresh, you will anchor the data strategy driving our aggressive, automation-first transformation. Our Global Customer Experience (GCX) team’s mission is to understand our customers’ journeys and empower market leads with insights and intelligent solutions that improve satisfaction, retention, and efficiency. We are moving fast to scale our self-serve rate, achieve 100% chatbot coverage, improve CSAT, and launch real-time, proactive incident communications via in-app CRM channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We need a strategic thought partner for our Product, Engineering, and CX Automation teams who brings a high bar of technical rigor. In this role, you will own our core automation analytics architecture (chatbots, voicebots, agent-assist AI, and customer self-reporting tools), dive deep into GenAI conversational landscapes, and translate complex log data into actionable roadmap strategies. If you love solving open-ended problems and want to directly shape the experience of millions of global customers, you might just be our missing ingredient.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anchor the data strategy for our entire automation and chatbot analytics infrastructure, serving as the sole embedded analytics lead within the Global CX department.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively monitor user intents and trends to diagnose system bugs early and establish standardized, organization-wide KPIs for bot containment and NLP accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct deep-dive analyses of chat transcripts and user journeys, leveraging semantic clustering and LLM evaluation to uncover friction points and tune conversational flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously optimize and secure our reporting environment, ensuring data integrity, normalization, and advanced visualization techniques for critical executive decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with cross-functional teams (Product, Engineering, and CX Automation) to translate complex customer log data and system requirements into sustainable roadmap strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and deliver core business reporting mechanisms and dashboards, including the Monthly Business Review (MBR) and EBIT reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for driving automation-first transformations and solving complex operational problems within a fast-paced customer experience environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in Python and SQL to handle increased domain complexity and secure our underlying reporting architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with next-gen agentic workflow stacks (e.g., Claude Code, Cursor) to optimize development and analytical speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of designing, implementing, and maintaining high-visibility BI solutions and dashboards that communicate trends clearly to Directors, VPs, and SVPs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills, with the confidence to lead complex data analytics projects and influence cross-functional partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global collaboration at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with experienced engineers and product partners across HelloTech’s international teams, in a culture of active knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology with real-world impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and operate modern systems at global scale, supporting 6+ millions of customers and complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical/Product/Design leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive best practices and influence architecture/design, quality, and ways of working in an autonomous, product-led setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end development/delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive decisions from problem definition to production, improving systems and enabling long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access to workspace at Warsaw Centre Point.&lt;/strong&gt; The hub offers modern facilities including showers, breakout zones, outdoor space, cycle parking, and refreshments (coffee, soft drinks, and fruit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you.&amp;nbsp; We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
